OL,3,GNEWSAPeople stabbed during large event
OL,4,Aat hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men have been arrested after
OL,7,Freports that people were stabbed at an
OL,8,Fevent at a hotel.
OL,10,FEssex Police said it was called to the
OL,11,Fvenue in Stifford Clays Road in North
OL,12,FStifford, near Thurrock, at about
OL,13,Fmidnight on Saturday.
OL,15,FA spokesperson said officers identified
OL,16,Ffour people with injuries including
OL,17,F"stab wounds" and about 100 people had
OL,18,Fbeen at the hotel at the time.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
