OL,3,GNEWSAPeople stabbed during large event
OL,4,Aat hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men, aged 24 and 25, both from
OL,7,FHackney in east London, were arrested
OL,8,Fon suspicion of causing grievous bodily
OL,9,Fharm with intent, while another man,
OL,10,F21, from Enfield in north London, was
OL,11,Farrested on suspicion of grievous
OL,12,Fbodily harm without intent.
